---
// Metrics: four large stats in a row, divided by hairlines.
---

<section class="bg-bg py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">By the numbers</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl">Less time managing work. More time doing it.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">We survey every Halcyon team after their first ninety days. This is what they tell us changed.</p>
    </div>

    <dl class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 border-t border-line sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:border-t-0">
      <div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-3 border-b border-line py-8 sm:pr-8 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-l lg:py-2 lg:pl-8 lg:pr-6">
        <dt class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">saved per person each week, mostly from status meetings that no longer need to happen</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-6xl">11h</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-3 border-b border-line py-8 sm:pl-8 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-l lg:py-2 lg:pr-6">
        <dt class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">fewer notifications than the tool each team used before switching</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-6xl">62%</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-3 border-b border-line py-8 sm:pr-8 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-l lg:py-2 lg:pl-8 lg:pr-6">
        <dt class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">of projects ship on or before the date the team first committed to</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-6xl">94%</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-3 border-b border-line py-8 sm:pl-8 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-l lg:py-2 lg:pr-6">
        <dt class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">teams planning their week in Halcyon, across 41 countries</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-6xl">4,200</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
